WEBVTT

00:00:00.095 --> 00:00:05.300
On the Select page, place the playhead and open Export a frame to see its frames.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:11.222
Step through with Next frame to find the sharpest picture.

00:00:11.222 --> 00:00:17.742
Export saves this frame as a PNG at its original size. This demo uses a prepared folder.

00:00:17.742 --> 00:00:24.969
The frame is saved. Closing Choose a frame returns to the Select page.
